## Job Title
Senior Technical Lead Architect (DEVOPS/Cloud)

## Job Summary
The Senior Technical Lead Architect is a critical role within our organization that will lead several key IT initiates including architecture, development, and deployment of Cloud-Based solutions primarily focused on our Android setting. This role requires specialized experience in agile methodology, algorithms, Android market, understanding of architecture and development, HTTP protocol familiarity, and scrum teamwork philosophy.

## Required Skills
- Strong knowledge of Agile and Scrum methodologies;
- Expertise and knowledge in Android ecosystem;
- Experience in Architecture design and development;
- Acquaintance with GIT as a version control tool;
- Proficient in HTTP as a communication protocol;
- Strong coding skills in algorithm design and optimization;
- Excellent problem-solving and management abilities.

##  Required Experience
- Minimum 3 years' experience as a Technical Lead Architect with DevOps/Cloud solutions;
- Additionally, at least 3 years' experience as a Senior Software Development Engineer mainly working with Android.

## Responsibilities
- Lead a team of developers while setting goals and timelines;
- Establish, enhance, and direct software coding, including quality and timeline/share code reviews;
- Ensure functional and responsive applications based on created architectures;
- Prepare detailed architectural designs' do~ data flow chart, features modeling from consumer perspective.



